Changelog: 14-11-2026 16:03:34

Release 1.2.0.

Changelog: 14-11-2026 15:33:23

Added. A click on the suite's icon in the header plays the Portal Tour over the whole screen, in the portal itself
(owner, 14-11-2026): the wiki's video, played from the wiki, so the portal does not carry it. A or Space pauses it
and plays on, B or Esc closes it, it closes by itself at its end, and its sound follows the Sound setting. Without a
connection the wiki's Portal Tour page opens in the browser. A click on the portal's name opens the wiki. The icon
opened the wiki, and the name did nothing. The Portal Tour is recorded again and shows both; the wiki's Portal and
Portal Tour pages say so.

Changelog: 14-11-2026 14:22:30

Added. The portal starts with its example wallpaper behind it. It had none until one was chosen. A picture of your
own goes before it, and No wallpaper in the Wallpaper pill's menu is remembered. A portal that had no wallpaper
shows the example after this update: choose No wallpaper once to have none again. The Portal Tour still starts
without a wallpaper and chooses the example.

